WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. Open Billing & Payments → Billing & invoices and select the exact school and family.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2. Review the original successful payment, linked invoice, ledger and any prior refund.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 3. Gather the approved reason and intended refund amount; the amount must be supported by the remaining refundable payment.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:38.453
Step 4. Directors without refund approval authority select Request Refund Approval. Review the exact family, payment, amount and reason before submitting the request.

00:00:38.453 --> 00:00:47.521
Step 5. Retain the request result and follow its review status. A submitted request does not mean money has been refunded.

00:00:47.521 --> 00:00:56.924
Step 6. After authorized processing, verify the provider refund status and local ledger before telling the family it is complete.

00:00:56.924 --> 00:01:05.924
Verify the result. Request status and completed refund status are distinguished.

